(5135872, 747919, 94855, '<td valign="top">being that I''d never heard of Bokeh and have spent the last week trying to learn about it and finding many varying opinoins on it is a tough one to judge... i like how you can seem to get more focus but it does seem a bit dark</td>', 'being that I''d never heard of Bokeh and have spent the last week trying to learn about it and finding many varying opinoins on it is a tough one to judge... i like how you can seem to get more focus but it does seem a bit dark', '2008-12-17 00:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5135873, 747901, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great color in the bokeh, I like the frost. Based on your title, I think either more DOF or focusing just to the right would have improved the display of the yellow. However, I like the very narrow DOF as you have chosen to display. IMO, the center composition weakens the impact because of the black "line" in the top right quadrant. Overall quite an enjoyable photograph.</td>', 'Great color in the bokeh, I like the frost. Based on your title, I think either more DOF or focusing just to the right would have improved the display of the yellow. However, I like the very narrow DOF as you have chosen to display. IMO, the center composition weakens the impact because of the black "line" in the top right quadrant. Overall quite an enjoyable photograph.', '2008-12-17 00:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5135876, 747660, 94855, '<td valign="top">being that I''d never heard of Bokeh and have spent the last week trying to learn about it and finding many varying opinoins on it is a tough one to judge</td>', 'being that I''d never heard of Bokeh and have spent the last week trying to learn about it and finding many varying opinoins on it is a tough one to judge', '2008-12-17 00:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
