(5136529, 747803, 51386, '<td valign="top">I would love to see more of the cat. With shots like this, where you have a fairly even background, it usually works really well to just fill the frame with your subject. It gives us a more intimate experience with the subject, that we would not usually feel by for example just seeing this cat outside.<br/> <br/>On a level of composition, it also gives the eye more room to explore, as it is not drawn out of the image. Since you have so much green space, my eye is immediately drawn to the point of contrast (the cat) which only takes up a small portion of the frame, and leads they eye straight out to the right.<br/> <br/>Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I would love to see more of the cat. With shots like this, where you have a fairly even background, it usually works really well to just fill the frame with your subject. It gives us a more intimate experience with the subject, that we would not usually feel by for example just seeing this cat outside. On a level of composition, it also gives the eye more room to explore, as it is not drawn out of the image. Since you have so much green space, my eye is immediately drawn to the point of contrast (the cat) which only takes up a small portion of the frame, and leads they eye straight out to the right. Hope this is helpful.', '2008-12-17 08:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5136531, 747736, 56002, '<td valign="top">Very cool bokeh... love the colors here.  If I HAD to guess... I would say this was skewsme.</td>', 'Very cool bokeh... love the colors here.  If I HAD to guess... I would say this was skewsme.', '2008-12-17 08:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5136532, 747917, 51386, '<td valign="top">I like it... Beautiful use of gradient to capture the viewers focus</td>', 'I like it... Beautiful use of gradient to capture the viewers focus', '2008-12-17 08:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5136535, 747592, 51386, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the flow of this photo, and the blond hair against the golden field and warm sunlight.<br/> <br/> I feel like the face could have used a little bit of fill. It seems slightly dark. Since for this challenge, you cannot use selective adjustments, it would have helped to perhaps use a reflector, to bounce a bit of light back into her face, or a tiny bit of fill flash (preferably off camera)</td>', 'Great shot. I love the flow of this photo, and the blond hair against the golden field and warm sunlight.  I feel like the face could have used a little bit of fill. It seems slightly dark. Since for this challenge, you cannot use selective adjustments, it would have helped to perhaps use a reflector, to bounce a bit of light back into her face, or a tiny bit of fill flash (preferably off camera)', '2008-12-17 08:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5136537, 747229, 76598, '<td valign="top">You may not be able to think of a title, but I think this is a great image, love the color and the complementary bokeh behind it.</td>', 'You may not be able to think of a title, but I think this is a great image, love the color and the complementary bokeh behind it.', '2008-12-17 08:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5136543, 746244, 51386, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how this relates to bokeh. It is very hard to use bokeh to enhance our subject with a dark background such as this one. Perhaps getting much closer to what you are shooting could be helpful.</td>', 'I am not sure how this relates to bokeh. It is very hard to use bokeh to enhance our subject with a dark background such as this one. Perhaps getting much closer to what you are shooting could be helpful.', '2008-12-17 08:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
