(5136563, 746893, 51386, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I like the warm glow from inside the house contrasting the cold blue of the night.<br/> <br/>This all seems pretty sharp. I dont really see any bokeh. The only thing that could kind of be classified as bokeh is the moon, but its more just defuse through he clouds imo. I have a feeling a your score may suffer from that a little.</td>', 'Nice capture. I like the warm glow from inside the house contrasting the cold blue of the night. This all seems pretty sharp. I dont really see any bokeh. The only thing that could kind of be classified as bokeh is the moon, but its more just defuse through he clouds imo. I have a feeling a your score may suffer from that a little.', '2008-12-17 08:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
