(5137583, 747553, 52500, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s a damn sharp fish!  That ain''t easy with fish alone, but shoot that bad boy with a Lensbaby and you''ve really accomplished something here!  Looks like you had to crank up the ISO to do it, but I don''t mind the noise at all.  This really is fantastic.  My highest score so far.</td>', 'Wow.  That''s a damn sharp fish!  That ain''t easy with fish alone, but shoot that bad boy with a Lensbaby and you''ve really accomplished something here!  Looks like you had to crank up the ISO to do it, but I don''t mind the noise at all.  This really is fantastic.  My highest score so far.', '2008-12-17 15:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137584, 747942, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is about as similar to <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=432081" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/592/120/432081.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/592/120/432081.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/592/120/432081.jpg"/></a> at it could get, which annoys me a little.  Not too much, though.  This is a fantastic image, after all.  I do wonder, though, if:<br/>1.  This is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5112" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ursula</a> <br/>2.  If not(1), then is this an homage, a copy, a crazy coincidence?<br/>In the end, I guess I''ll give you an 8.  That''s not too bad, right?</td>', 'This is about as similar to  at it could get, which annoys me a little.  Not too much, though.  This is a fantastic image, after all.  I do wonder, though, if:1.  This is  ursula 2.  If not(1), then is this an homage, a copy, a crazy coincidence?In the end, I guess I''ll give you an 8.  That''s not too bad, right?', '2008-12-17 15:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
