(5138744, 747946, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the POP of hot pink.</td>', 'Love the POP of hot pink.', '2008-12-18 08:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138745, 747933, 15711, '<td valign="top">I would like it more if the pods were less centered.  Beautiful bokeh and great DOF.</td>', 'I would like it more if the pods were less centered.  Beautiful bokeh and great DOF.', '2008-12-18 08:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138760, 747689, 58457, '<td valign="top">Thats either a dead hummingbird or a ridiculously fast shutter/flash!</td>', 'Thats either a dead hummingbird or a ridiculously fast shutter/flash!', '2008-12-18 09:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138773, 747963, 58457, '<td valign="top">I almost think it would work better without the snowflakes.  They end up just looking like big white pixels.  I could see this as a series of monstrous huge prints in an art gallery titled "study of wind and trees" or something like that.  good luck.</td>', 'I almost think it would work better without the snowflakes.  They end up just looking like big white pixels.  I could see this as a series of monstrous huge prints in an art gallery titled "study of wind and trees" or something like that.  good luck.', '2008-12-18 09:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138775, 746893, 99497, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. But can''t see how it applies to the challenge as every thing looks to be in focus. Even the clouds. 6 from me</td>', 'Beautiful photo. But can''t see how it applies to the challenge as every thing looks to be in focus. Even the clouds. 6 from me', '2008-12-18 09:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138778, 747675, 99497, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. I feel a different composition (may from the top) would have produced a nicer effect</td>', 'Nice subject. I feel a different composition (may from the top) would have produced a nicer effect', '2008-12-18 09:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138780, 747422, 99497, '<td valign="top">Very nice and different photo. Has an abstract feel to it. Like the fact that you haven''t gone overboard to show off the bokeh.</td>', 'Very nice and different photo. Has an abstract feel to it. Like the fact that you haven''t gone overboard to show off the bokeh.', '2008-12-18 09:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138782, 747925, 99497, '<td valign="top">Has a soothing feel to it because of the flower in the bottom.</td>', 'Has a soothing feel to it because of the flower in the bottom.', '2008-12-18 09:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138800, 747075, 100495, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of the background here.  I like the fact that the branches don''t detract from the image even though they''re very strong in their own right.</td>', 'I''m a big fan of the background here.  I like the fact that the branches don''t detract from the image even though they''re very strong in their own right.', '2008-12-18 09:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138803, 748018, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice background and a solid subject.  Well exposed (no pun intended)</td>', 'Nice background and a solid subject.  Well exposed (no pun intended)', '2008-12-18 09:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138804, 748025, 100495, '<td valign="top">Good colour throughout.  Seasonal, but nicely different.</td>', 'Good colour throughout.  Seasonal, but nicely different.', '2008-12-18 09:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138805, 748037, 100495, '<td valign="top">For me the background challenges a lot for the attention of the viewer.  I think it''s the combination of horizontal and vertical lines.  It''s a bit busy.</td>', 'For me the background challenges a lot for the attention of the viewer.  I think it''s the combination of horizontal and vertical lines.  It''s a bit busy.', '2008-12-18 09:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138806, 747577, 100495, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Should do well.</td>', 'Lovely.  Should do well.', '2008-12-18 09:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138810, 747877, 100495, '<td valign="top">The calm background really makes the subject stand out.  Nice composition.</td>', 'The calm background really makes the subject stand out.  Nice composition.', '2008-12-18 09:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138812, 746893, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but I''m not seeing any bokeh.  If anything it''s not OOF enough at the back?</td>', 'I like the photo, but I''m not seeing any bokeh.  If anything it''s not OOF enough at the back?', '2008-12-18 09:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138816, 747037, 100495, '<td valign="top">What was he poking his tongue out at??<br/> <br/>I like the sun-lit background and think it really adds to the ambiance.  Nice colours.</td>', 'What was he poking his tongue out at?? I like the sun-lit background and think it really adds to the ambiance.  Nice colours.', '2008-12-18 09:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138818, 747660, 93927, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful. i think i would like it more if there were white lights in the background, but i''m a sucker for white christmas lights :P great job!</td>', 'this is beautiful. i think i would like it more if there were white lights in the background, but i''m a sucker for white christmas lights :P great job!', '2008-12-18 09:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138820, 747791, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed and composed, with a lot of interest.<br/> <br/>Would do equally well in a DOF challenge.</td>', 'Nicely exposed and composed, with a lot of interest. Would do equally well in a DOF challenge.', '2008-12-18 09:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138821, 748016, 100495, '<td valign="top">It''s a very bright (correctly exposed) subject but quite a dark (correct bokeh) background.  Christmas tree lights on would have made a huge difference.</td>', 'It''s a very bright (correctly exposed) subject but quite a dark (correct bokeh) background.  Christmas tree lights on would have made a huge difference.', '2008-12-18 09:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138822, 747218, 93927, '<td valign="top">i would really like to see the original image, looks like a good find. i think the over processing is too much.</td>', 'i would really like to see the original image, looks like a good find. i think the over processing is too much.', '2008-12-18 09:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138827, 746956, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The bottle is obvious, but not overbearing.<br/> <br/>I like the jaunty angle.</td>', 'Very nice.  The bottle is obvious, but not overbearing. I like the jaunty angle.', '2008-12-18 09:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138829, 747108, 93927, '<td valign="top">lol this makes me laugh. i love the little expression on his face!</td>', 'lol this makes me laugh. i love the little expression on his face!', '2008-12-18 09:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138832, 747268, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great idea. <br/> <br/>No offence, but with a little less background blur this would have done really well in the personifiaction challenge.  Is this in the correct challenge?</td>', 'Great idea.  No offence, but with a little less background blur this would have done really well in the personifiaction challenge.  Is this in the correct challenge?', '2008-12-18 09:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
