(5138839, 747919, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the layers and depth in this.  Very brave use of darkness everywhere.<br/> <br/>Minor picky point, it looks a bit like an advert because of the name on the ash-tray.</td>', 'I like the layers and depth in this.  Very brave use of darkness everywhere. Minor picky point, it looks a bit like an advert because of the name on the ash-tray.', '2008-12-18 10:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
