(5138860, 747946, 100495, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, a really brave single-colour shot.  You''ve even got a leading line down the right hand side.  Should do really well.</td>', 'This is beautiful, a really brave single-colour shot.  You''ve even got a leading line down the right hand side.  Should do really well.', '2008-12-18 10:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138864, 748040, 100495, '<td valign="top">You''re obviously joking, but I think that is the best multicolour bokeh on here.  Shame it''s not bigger because that is great.</td>', 'You''re obviously joking, but I think that is the best multicolour bokeh on here.  Shame it''s not bigger because that is great.', '2008-12-18 10:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138867, 747942, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very delicate, good focus and composition.</td>', 'Very delicate, good focus and composition.', '2008-12-18 10:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138869, 747896, 70375, '<td valign="top">While this is a very creative idea for this challenge, your main subject is just too dark. We can''t really get a feeling for the child''s emotion here because of the underexposure. Here is a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=49" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> that may help.</td>', 'While this is a very creative idea for this challenge, your main subject is just too dark. We can''t really get a feeling for the child''s emotion here because of the underexposure. Here is a tutorial that may help.', '2008-12-18 10:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138870, 747622, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice.<br/> <br/>My natural reaction was to move my head to the left to try to frame the sunlight in the ring.</td>', 'Nice. My natural reaction was to move my head to the left to try to frame the sunlight in the ring.', '2008-12-18 10:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138871, 746946, 100495, '<td valign="top">A tad flat for me.</td>', 'A tad flat for me.', '2008-12-18 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138872, 747736, 100495, '<td valign="top">Love the way the lines all point to the subject.</td>', 'Love the way the lines all point to the subject.', '2008-12-18 10:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138878, 747879, 100495, '<td valign="top">Like the leading line.<br/> <br/>How did you get such a good focus on such a fast-moving subject???</td>', 'Like the leading line. How did you get such a good focus on such a fast-moving subject???', '2008-12-18 10:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138883, 748029, 100495, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more of the subject.</td>', 'I wish I could see more of the subject.', '2008-12-18 10:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138900, 747587, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your light is really very nice. Your focus is either a bit soft or the lens you used is not very good because it has made your focus seem a bit soft. Placement of the main subject, the flower, could be improved, IMO. Perhaps a tad more left. Your colours here are a nice blend... yellow and blue make green... very complimentary.</td>', 'Your light is really very nice. Your focus is either a bit soft or the lens you used is not very good because it has made your focus seem a bit soft. Placement of the main subject, the flower, could be improved, IMO. Perhaps a tad more left. Your colours here are a nice blend... yellow and blue make green... very complimentary.', '2008-12-18 10:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138920, 747592, 99497, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. Love the light on the kid and the soothing background bokeh.Only nit is the area near the top could have been cropped out a bit, but still it is an excellent capture</td>', 'Very nice picture. Love the light on the kid and the soothing background bokeh.Only nit is the area near the top could have been cropped out a bit, but still it is an excellent capture', '2008-12-18 10:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138928, 747988, 101309, '<td valign="top">she kinda freaks me out...but good bokeh. I give it an 8!</td>', 'she kinda freaks me out...but good bokeh. I give it an 8!', '2008-12-18 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138930, 747927, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the bokeh but the main object is almost invisible, or where it''s visible it is OOf. I think you would have a great shot using the spider silk in another perspective! Good luck!</td>', 'I like the bokeh but the main object is almost invisible, or where it''s visible it is OOf. I think you would have a great shot using the spider silk in another perspective! Good luck!', '2008-12-18 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138954, 748038, 100495, '<td valign="top">Big bokeh.<br/> <br/>That almost looks like an in-focus spotted background.</td>', 'Big bokeh. That almost looks like an in-focus spotted background.', '2008-12-18 10:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138956, 747984, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very colourful but it''s a bit busy for me.</td>', 'Very colourful but it''s a bit busy for me.', '2008-12-18 10:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138958, 747355, 100495, '<td valign="top">That''s a really great concept and well executed.</td>', 'That''s a really great concept and well executed.', '2008-12-18 10:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138959, 748041, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern in the background and excellent composition.</td>', 'Nice pattern in the background and excellent composition.', '2008-12-18 10:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138960, 747965, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very nice, lots in interest.</td>', 'Very nice, lots in interest.', '2008-12-18 10:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138961, 747927, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very ethereal and nice lighting.</td>', 'Very ethereal and nice lighting.', '2008-12-18 10:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138963, 746244, 100495, '<td valign="top">I won''t vote on this because I think my monitor isn''t doing it justice.  I can''t see bokeh.</td>', 'I won''t vote on this because I think my monitor isn''t doing it justice.  I can''t see bokeh.', '2008-12-18 10:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138965, 747784, 100495, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve missed an opportunity here.  The skyline bokeh shot would have worked really well without a foreground subject, so that the lights made a wide landscape which would work in its own right.</td>', 'I think you''ve missed an opportunity here.  The skyline bokeh shot would have worked really well without a foreground subject, so that the lights made a wide landscape which would work in its own right.', '2008-12-18 10:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138966, 747779, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition and pose.  Very engaging.</td>', 'Very strong composition and pose.  Very engaging.', '2008-12-18 11:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138968, 747508, 100495, '<td valign="top">For me the foreground and background bokeh make my eyes scan all over the image, rather than having a focal point.  The moisture is so small that it competes with the bokeh.  However, it''s a very appealing image and brave in B/W - 7.</td>', 'For me the foreground and background bokeh make my eyes scan all over the image, rather than having a focal point.  The moisture is so small that it competes with the bokeh.  However, it''s a very appealing image and brave in B/W - 7.', '2008-12-18 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138969, 746566, 86359, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is obvious ,but overwhelms the subject</td>', 'The bokeh is obvious ,but overwhelms the subject', '2008-12-18 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138971, 747962, 96626, '<td valign="top">Did you really shoot it during the Challenge''s time ?! Lucky ! Woaw, say me where are so greeeens tree ! =)</td>', 'Did you really shoot it during the Challenge''s time ?! Lucky ! Woaw, say me where are so greeeens tree ! =)', '2008-12-18 11:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138972, 746677, 100495, '<td valign="top">This is the first pic in this challenge that tells a story.  Excellent focus on the beetle''s antennae but it makes the back look OOF.</td>', 'This is the first pic in this challenge that tells a story.  Excellent focus on the beetle''s antennae but it makes the back look OOF.', '2008-12-18 11:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138974, 747229, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the complementary colours in this but I think more light behind the glass or more background lights would have added a lot to this.</td>', 'I like the complementary colours in this but I think more light behind the glass or more background lights would have added a lot to this.', '2008-12-18 11:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138975, 747822, 100495, '<td valign="top">What a great ''fairy tale'' image.  Full of emotion.</td>', 'What a great ''fairy tale'' image.  Full of emotion.', '2008-12-18 11:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138976, 747551, 86359, '<td valign="top">Maybe I am wrong , but the bokeh can''t be the subject for itself, it is a technique to enhance the subject.</td>', 'Maybe I am wrong , but the bokeh can''t be the subject for itself, it is a technique to enhance the subject.', '2008-12-18 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138985, 747489, 100495, '<td valign="top">That''s great bokeh, but a little (geddit?) busy for me with the almost in-focus branches.</td>', 'That''s great bokeh, but a little (geddit?) busy for me with the almost in-focus branches.', '2008-12-18 11:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138986, 747860, 96626, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m curious : Where does a so beautifull butterfly live ?</td>', 'Sorry, I''m curious : Where does a so beautifull butterfly live ?', '2008-12-18 11:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138995, 747925, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the contents, but I think the image would be stronger with less ''void'' in the middle.  The pink flowers are excellent, but the green swathe adds little for me.</td>', 'I like the contents, but I think the image would be stronger with less ''void'' in the middle.  The pink flowers are excellent, but the green swathe adds little for me.', '2008-12-18 11:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138998, 747215, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the way the bokeh grows from left to right.  This would be another good DOF challenge entry.</td>', 'I like the way the bokeh grows from left to right.  This would be another good DOF challenge entry.', '2008-12-18 11:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138999, 747541, 100495, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Great colours and a very striking image.  Should do very well.</td>', 'WOW.  Great colours and a very striking image.  Should do very well.', '2008-12-18 11:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
