(5139492, 748022, 99981, '<td valign="top">I can''t see a good bokeh in this photo! The tree is a little OOF and i think you had great objects there, you could have done a great shot too! Try again, i''m sure you''ll get better results!</td>', 'I can''t see a good bokeh in this photo! The tree is a little OOF and i think you had great objects there, you could have done a great shot too! Try again, i''m sure you''ll get better results!', '2008-12-18 16:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
