(5139497, 746805, 99981, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo but i don''t see any sign of bokeh there because the foreground and the background are not well defined!</td>', 'This is a great photo but i don''t see any sign of bokeh there because the foreground and the background are not well defined!', '2008-12-18 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139498, 747709, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the gray border and the size of this image. I like the object and the way you put it behind the bars...I just think the bokeh is too reduced there and i''m not a fan of this B&amp;W.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the gray border and the size of this image. I like the object and the way you put it behind the bars...I just think the bokeh is too reduced there and i''m not a fan of this B&W.', '2008-12-18 16:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139501, 747816, 99981, '<td valign="top">You have a good bokeh there, maybe too grainy but you did it. If the object wasn''t dark like that your photo would be much better! Those white and red lights on the bottom are kind of distractive too.</td>', 'You have a good bokeh there, maybe too grainy but you did it. If the object wasn''t dark like that your photo would be much better! Those white and red lights on the bottom are kind of distractive too.', '2008-12-18 16:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139504, 747072, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good capture. The background adds a nice touch to the main subject. Well done!</td>', 'Good capture. The background adds a nice touch to the main subject. Well done!', '2008-12-18 16:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139505, 747949, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting. Nice work.</td>', 'Looks like a painting. Nice work.', '2008-12-18 16:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139507, 748025, 99981, '<td valign="top">The jingle ball is OOF but you have great colors there, the bokeh is not really cool but the beatiful colors helped a lot!</td>', 'The jingle ball is OOF but you have great colors there, the bokeh is not really cool but the beatiful colors helped a lot!', '2008-12-18 16:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139509, 747900, 99981, '<td valign="top">The star is parcially OOF and have some distracting aspects, as the red light that didn''t work for me an the upper part of it. The background is out of focus but i don''t see a good bokeh there, maybe more distance between the main object and the background would help!</td>', 'The star is parcially OOF and have some distracting aspects, as the red light that didn''t work for me an the upper part of it. The background is out of focus but i don''t see a good bokeh there, maybe more distance between the main object and the background would help!', '2008-12-18 16:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139510, 747588, 99981, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be better without the border. The flower have some parts out of focus and the background is too dark, which is really not cool for bokeh. The left part has almost a good bokeh, but i think you lost a lot with the dark parts.</td>', 'I think this shot would be better without the border. The flower have some parts out of focus and the background is too dark, which is really not cool for bokeh. The left part has almost a good bokeh, but i think you lost a lot with the dark parts.', '2008-12-18 16:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139511, 747711, 94235, '<td valign="top">Effective use of the background lights. Pleasing to the eye. Good job!</td>', 'Effective use of the background lights. Pleasing to the eye. Good job!', '2008-12-18 16:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139514, 747344, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of B&amp;W but i think you did a good job with the object. Maybe you could have a better Bokeh there.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of B&W but i think you did a good job with the object. Maybe you could have a better Bokeh there.', '2008-12-18 16:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139515, 747074, 99981, '<td valign="top">Good use of the ladybug colors! Just think this photo is too noisy and i don''t see good bokeh there!</td>', 'Good use of the ladybug colors! Just think this photo is too noisy and i don''t see good bokeh there!', '2008-12-18 16:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139516, 747354, 99981, '<td valign="top">You have some good circles there huh? Just think you missed a lot of focus at the main object! Nice shot!</td>', 'You have some good circles there huh? Just think you missed a lot of focus at the main object! Nice shot!', '2008-12-18 16:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139517, 747489, 99981, '<td valign="top">I think the object is a little OOF and his colors could be stronger! I like your idea an i think you almost had a good bokeh there, just think that are some distractive OOF parts in your photo.</td>', 'I think the object is a little OOF and his colors could be stronger! I like your idea an i think you almost had a good bokeh there, just think that are some distractive OOF parts in your photo.', '2008-12-18 16:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139518, 747095, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well...the object is kind of OOF, and i''m not sure about the background because it''s too dark, but your idea may have been hard to execute and the color of the flower is beautiful!</td>', 'Well...the object is kind of OOF, and i''m not sure about the background because it''s too dark, but your idea may have been hard to execute and the color of the flower is beautiful!', '2008-12-18 16:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139519, 748024, 94235, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen all the foreground a little sharper but the background effect and the angle looks great! Well done.</td>', 'Would like to have seen all the foreground a little sharper but the background effect and the angle looks great! Well done.', '2008-12-18 16:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139520, 747936, 99981, '<td valign="top">The candle takes almost all the photo and the light on it distracts too much. I think you got a good bokeh, but it''s almost hidden behind the candle!</td>', 'The candle takes almost all the photo and the light on it distracts too much. I think you got a good bokeh, but it''s almost hidden behind the candle!', '2008-12-18 16:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139521, 747822, 99981, '<td valign="top">Nice Bokeh, good light! The object could be other and the title too, since the christmas theme was kind of obvious. The object seems to be a little OOF too.</td>', 'Nice Bokeh, good light! The object could be other and the title too, since the christmas theme was kind of obvious. The object seems to be a little OOF too.', '2008-12-18 16:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139522, 747965, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I just don''t see a good bokeh there! I really liked the light and the choice of object!</td>', 'Great photo! I just don''t see a good bokeh there! I really liked the light and the choice of object!', '2008-12-18 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139523, 746598, 99981, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and beatiful choice for an object! The bokeh could be better in my opinion.</td>', 'Good lighting and beatiful choice for an object! The bokeh could be better in my opinion.', '2008-12-18 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139524, 746907, 99981, '<td valign="top">The "wow factor" as some people say is kind of weak in my opinion! I''m not really sure about the bokeh, maybe it could be better! But i think you did a great job with the light!</td>', 'The "wow factor" as some people say is kind of weak in my opinion! I''m not really sure about the bokeh, maybe it could be better! But i think you did a great job with the light!', '2008-12-18 16:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139525, 748038, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like your background and the bokeh. The object is OOF but have nice colors! Good luck!</td>', 'I like your background and the bokeh. The object is OOF but have nice colors! Good luck!', '2008-12-18 16:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139526, 747164, 99981, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is good and the object too...The christmas photos are just too out of that "wow factor" that everyone says...I like this photo though!</td>', 'The bokeh is good and the object too...The christmas photos are just too out of that "wow factor" that everyone says...I like this photo though!', '2008-12-18 16:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139527, 747804, 99981, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh, the main object seems to be a OOF but you got great colors there! It''s a shame this is another christmas photo, a diferent object with the lights behind would be great!</td>', 'Nice bokeh, the main object seems to be a OOF but you got great colors there! It''s a shame this is another christmas photo, a diferent object with the lights behind would be great!', '2008-12-18 16:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139528, 748029, 99981, '<td valign="top">Woa! There''s a lot of christmas pictures in this challenge! I don''t think it''s a bad thing, because i really like those circles of lights as background! About your christmas..i think the object could be much brighter and with more focus.</td>', 'Woa! There''s a lot of christmas pictures in this challenge! I don''t think it''s a bad thing, because i really like those circles of lights as background! About your christmas..i think the object could be much brighter and with more focus.', '2008-12-18 16:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139531, 748018, 94235, '<td valign="top">Brrrrr.....maybe needs a bit more to fill the background, looks a little empty but still a nice capture.</td>', 'Brrrrr.....maybe needs a bit more to fill the background, looks a little empty but still a nice capture.', '2008-12-18 16:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139532, 747950, 99981, '<td valign="top">There is a photo really similar to that one in this challenge! The diference is between the perspective and colors! hehe I like the main object, despite that it could be in another position, to give us the chance to see the water drops on it! The flowers with the bokeh efect are almost good! But i think you missed there just a bit! Great colors and good work!</td>', 'There is a photo really similar to that one in this challenge! The diference is between the perspective and colors! hehe I like the main object, despite that it could be in another position, to give us the chance to see the water drops on it! The flowers with the bokeh efect are almost good! But i think you missed there just a bit! Great colors and good work!', '2008-12-18 16:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139533, 747904, 99981, '<td valign="top">Good job!  I just think all the butterflyes could be in bokeh aspects and i''m not a fan of the title!</td>', 'Good job!  I just think all the butterflyes could be in bokeh aspects and i''m not a fan of the title!', '2008-12-18 16:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139534, 747917, 99981, '<td valign="top">Good bokeh, kind of creamy as much people like. I just think you could have used this green better. Maybe more brighter?</td>', 'Good bokeh, kind of creamy as much people like. I just think you could have used this green better. Maybe more brighter?', '2008-12-18 16:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139535, 748024, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great color and good use of the polemic "circles of light". The black thing on the right top is kind of distracting and maybe more focus on the ice would be better! I like it!</td>', 'Great color and good use of the polemic "circles of light". The black thing on the right top is kind of distracting and maybe more focus on the ice would be better! I like it!', '2008-12-18 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139536, 746461, 99981, '<td valign="top">The right bottom is kind of OOF and dark, like some other parts of the cricket. I like the Bokeh but it could be more soft. I really like the colors (mostly the red eye) and the water drops too!</td>', 'The right bottom is kind of OOF and dark, like some other parts of the cricket. I like the Bokeh but it could be more soft. I really like the colors (mostly the red eye) and the water drops too!', '2008-12-18 16:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139539, 747997, 99981, '<td valign="top">The object is OOF but this Bokeh works a lot for me!</td>', 'The object is OOF but this Bokeh works a lot for me!', '2008-12-18 16:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139541, 747716, 99981, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!</td>', 'Nice photo!', '2008-12-18 16:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139542, 747953, 99981, '<td valign="top">Gus is out of focus! I''m not a huge fan of B&amp;W but you definettly did a great job with the bokeh!</td>', 'Gus is out of focus! I''m not a huge fan of B&W but you definettly did a great job with the bokeh!', '2008-12-18 16:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139544, 748018, 99981, '<td valign="top">I saw a photo so similar to yours other day...But the lighting and the bokeh are really cool! Just don''t know about the creativity, sorry if i''m wrong, maybe it''s a wrong impression.</td>', 'I saw a photo so similar to yours other day...But the lighting and the bokeh are really cool! Just don''t know about the creativity, sorry if i''m wrong, maybe it''s a wrong impression.', '2008-12-18 16:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139545, 747863, 99981, '<td valign="top">The right part of the flower is just a little bit OOF, but the colors and the Bokeh are great! Nicely done!</td>', 'The right part of the flower is just a little bit OOF, but the colors and the Bokeh are great! Nicely done!', '2008-12-18 16:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139546, 747949, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great light, beautiful colors and good bokeh!</td>', 'Great light, beautiful colors and good bokeh!', '2008-12-18 16:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139548, 746461, 94235, '<td valign="top">Had a second look at this one and increased your score. In my opinion you have achieved a nice subtle bokeh with a very interesting, and detailed foreground. Great Job.</td>', 'Had a second look at this one and increased your score. In my opinion you have achieved a nice subtle bokeh with a very interesting, and detailed foreground. Great Job.', '2008-12-18 16:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139554, 748032, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the bokeh very much. I like the object too, but i don''t know what it is, hehe! A better title would be great! Nice shot!</td>', 'I like the colors and the bokeh very much. I like the object too, but i don''t know what it is, hehe! A better title would be great! Nice shot!', '2008-12-18 17:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139557, 747462, 99981, '<td valign="top">That''s it! There is a small part of the bird OOF, but Bokeh is great there! So as the colors and your choice of object + background.</td>', 'That''s it! There is a small part of the bird OOF, but Bokeh is great there! So as the colors and your choice of object + background.', '2008-12-18 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139560, 747232, 99981, '<td valign="top">I always look at green colors with a good impression, just a taste, hehe. Your photo is obviously great, but i would like to see <strike>a background with more colors</strike> the frog from another perspective! I liked the bokeh too! Changing my vote..loved this photo!</td>', 'I always look at green colors with a good impression, just a taste, hehe. Your photo is obviously great, but i would like to see a background with more colors the frog from another perspective! I liked the bokeh too! Changing my vote..loved this photo!', '2008-12-18 17:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139561, 747877, 99981, '<td valign="top">Works a lot for me!</td>', 'Works a lot for me!', '2008-12-18 17:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5139563, 747925, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great job with the bokeh! The colors of the background are great and this is a very creamy background, which is good for bokeh as i learned. The object is simple, well focused and calm, as the title.</td>', 'Great job with the bokeh! The colors of the background are great and this is a very creamy background, which is good for bokeh as i learned. The object is simple, well focused and calm, as the title.', '2008-12-18 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
