(5140008, 747784, 70375, '<td valign="top">A point to remember when shooting a photograph. Your subject needs to catch and hold interest. While your bokeh is very pretty, I can''t tell what it is and it frustrates me. So it doesn''t make a good subject. Therefore, I turn to the person. Still, I am frustrated because I can''t see that person and the silhouette isn''t giving me any indication of what is going on here either. Perhaps if you would have included more of the person in the frame or blurred the bokeh just a tad less it would have worked beautifully. As it is, it doesn''t catch and hold my attention. Good luck :)</td>', 'A point to remember when shooting a photograph. Your subject needs to catch and hold interest. While your bokeh is very pretty, I can''t tell what it is and it frustrates me. So it doesn''t make a good subject. Therefore, I turn to the person. Still, I am frustrated because I can''t see that person and the silhouette isn''t giving me any indication of what is going on here either. Perhaps if you would have included more of the person in the frame or blurred the bokeh just a tad less it would have worked beautifully. As it is, it doesn''t catch and hold my attention. Good luck :)', '2008-12-18 22:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
