(5140188, 747896, 51386, '<td valign="top">Great concept here. It would be nice to have some fill on the subjects face. Its hard to focs n him at all with so little light. Maybe a flash, or even a desklamp could really draw some interest to the face</td>', 'Great concept here. It would be nice to have some fill on the subjects face. Its hard to focs n him at all with so little light. Maybe a flash, or even a desklamp could really draw some interest to the face', '2008-12-19 02:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
