(5140193, 746329, 51386, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept with the xmas lights in the background.<br/> <br/>I think what would really improve this photography is a touch of lighting on the subject. Right now, the light is quite flat, which does not add any definition to your santa. Try playing with some lights (even just desklamps) and move them around to see how it changes the quality and mood of your photo.</td>', 'Interesting concept with the xmas lights in the background. I think what would really improve this photography is a touch of lighting on the subject. Right now, the light is quite flat, which does not add any definition to your santa. Try playing with some lights (even just desklamps) and move them around to see how it changes the quality and mood of your photo.', '2008-12-19 02:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
