(5140413, 747902, 100727, '<td valign="top">At least a photo that is different from the so many bokeh photos that have this weird "orb" thing as bokeh!  Nice composition and it makes the viewer wonder what he/she is doing or baking!</td>', 'At least a photo that is different from the so many bokeh photos that have this weird "orb" thing as bokeh!  Nice composition and it makes the viewer wonder what he/she is doing or baking!', '2008-12-19 08:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140418, 747879, 100727, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot!  Unlike so many other photos which have the "orb" thing as bokeh, this photo brought a big surprise!  Also, it''s a tortoise and not a frog (thank goodness for a change!).  I love the composition.  It shows the distance the tortoise has walked and the trail it is leaving behind.  Great shot and great colour!  10!</td>', 'This is a really nice shot!  Unlike so many other photos which have the "orb" thing as bokeh, this photo brought a big surprise!  Also, it''s a tortoise and not a frog (thank goodness for a change!).  I love the composition.  It shows the distance the tortoise has walked and the trail it is leaving behind.  Great shot and great colour!  10!', '2008-12-19 08:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
