(5140540, 746967, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, just my style, but I have a feeling it''s going to get slammed because of the lack of obvious bokeh. Fave from me nonetheless!</td>', 'Great portrait, just my style, but I have a feeling it''s going to get slammed because of the lack of obvious bokeh. Fave from me nonetheless!', '2008-12-19 09:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140544, 747919, 47791, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...absolutely beautiful. This deserves to win. <br/>You really caught the spirit of a pub. <br/>Theres a smoking ban in most pubs in Europe now so this is a very nostalgiac image to me as I used to smoke. <br/>I hope you do well as opposed to the few dozen Christmas tree and water drop entries. Your image is original and your doing your own thing 10/10.<br/>In fact if you crop the top so that its just the stools in the beckground it looks even better.</td>', 'Beautiful...absolutely beautiful. This deserves to win. You really caught the spirit of a pub. Theres a smoking ban in most pubs in Europe now so this is a very nostalgiac image to me as I used to smoke. I hope you do well as opposed to the few dozen Christmas tree and water drop entries. Your image is original and your doing your own thing 10/10.In fact if you crop the top so that its just the stools in the beckground it looks even better.', '2008-12-19 09:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
