(5140561, 747619, 87252, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot but - and I don''t normally have a problem with this - the frame is really distracting and unnecessary. The beauty of this shot IMO lies in the subdued grey/brown tones of the background offset by the flash of red in the foreground. The Frame really kills the subtlety I think. Cool shot though.</td>', 'I do like this shot but - and I don''t normally have a problem with this - the frame is really distracting and unnecessary. The beauty of this shot IMO lies in the subdued grey/brown tones of the background offset by the flash of red in the foreground. The Frame really kills the subtlety I think. Cool shot though.', '2008-12-19 09:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140565, 747791, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice one - I''ve got a shot like this.</td>', 'Nice one - I''ve got a shot like this.', '2008-12-19 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140568, 747138, 99981, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the bokeh. The background is really distractive, and the hand is a little oof.</td>', 'I don''t like the bokeh. The background is really distractive, and the hand is a little oof.', '2008-12-19 09:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140571, 746521, 99311, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo according to me as -<br/>1) It highlights the purpose of the challenge<br/>2) The moments/subjects like this are difficult to capture and are not something which one witness day to day<br/>3) The lighting and the focus is good.<br/> <br/>Few suggestions which would have improved it further -<br/>1) If the backround was more creamy blurr (again that depends on the lens .. so if you dont have the better telephoto lens then nothing you can do)<br/>2) If the subject was on the right 1/3 frame rather than on the left unless you wanted to crop out something from the right frame</td>', 'This is a very good photo according to me as -1) It highlights the purpose of the challenge2) The moments/subjects like this are difficult to capture and are not something which one witness day to day3) The lighting and the focus is good. Few suggestions which would have improved it further -1) If the backround was more creamy blurr (again that depends on the lens .. so if you dont have the better telephoto lens then nothing you can do)2) If the subject was on the right 1/3 frame rather than on the left unless you wanted to crop out something from the right frame', '2008-12-19 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140575, 746329, 87252, '<td valign="top">This needs a bit of Work IMO. Nice idea - cool use of a shaped filter. I don''t think the composition on santa is quite there, maybe slighly further back and sitting flat. Also this is a bit noisy - probably due to shooting at high ISO because it was dark. Try using noise Ninja or Neat image to sort these problems out.</td>', 'This needs a bit of Work IMO. Nice idea - cool use of a shaped filter. I don''t think the composition on santa is quite there, maybe slighly further back and sitting flat. Also this is a bit noisy - probably due to shooting at high ISO because it was dark. Try using noise Ninja or Neat image to sort these problems out.', '2008-12-19 09:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140576, 747779, 100727, '<td valign="top">A different kind of bokeh.  There are plenty of photos in this challenge that use the "orb" kind of background as bokeh, and it''s boring, at least for me.  In this photo, I like the contrast of the foreground against the background.</td>', 'A different kind of bokeh.  There are plenty of photos in this challenge that use the "orb" kind of background as bokeh, and it''s boring, at least for me.  In this photo, I like the contrast of the foreground against the background.', '2008-12-19 09:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140577, 747657, 99981, '<td valign="top">The bokeh isn''t good for me, the wine glass was a good choice for theme, but i think it''s really oof and dark.</td>', 'The bokeh isn''t good for me, the wine glass was a good choice for theme, but i think it''s really oof and dark.', '2008-12-19 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
