(5140833, 746285, 52854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Love the light and overall feel. 9</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Love the light and overall feel. 9', '2008-12-19 12:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140838, 747263, 52854, '<td valign="top">Really like the photo - vivid color and nice bokeh. 9</td>', 'Really like the photo - vivid color and nice bokeh. 9', '2008-12-19 12:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140841, 747711, 99981, '<td valign="top">In the middle of hundred christmas themes, you got a good photo! The theme is not much interesting, but you got a good bokeh there and great details at your object, so as the colors!</td>', 'In the middle of hundred christmas themes, you got a good photo! The theme is not much interesting, but you got a good bokeh there and great details at your object, so as the colors!', '2008-12-19 12:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140842, 747215, 52854, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - I like the color and the overall feel.</td>', 'Nice photo - I like the color and the overall feel.', '2008-12-19 12:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140848, 747911, 99981, '<td valign="top">It''s out of focus and dark, i can see a bokeh but no really good...The object is almost invisible because of the darkness. Next time use more light, i know it will be better! :D</td>', 'It''s out of focus and dark, i can see a bokeh but no really good...The object is almost invisible because of the darkness. Next time use more light, i know it will be better! :D', '2008-12-19 12:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140853, 747942, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but i''m kind of confused about what is the object. Maybe a part of a flower with water drops...I see that is some bokeh on the right to, but again it isn''t clear for me. Like the border and the efects you created!</td>', 'I like this photo but i''m kind of confused about what is the object. Maybe a part of a flower with water drops...I see that is some bokeh on the right to, but again it isn''t clear for me. Like the border and the efects you created!', '2008-12-19 12:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140855, 747082, 99981, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the colors of that leafs, but i don''t think B&amp;W was the better choice there! Your bokeh is good, but in my opinion it lost some "wow factor" without the colors! Nice photo though!</td>', 'I don''t know the colors of that leafs, but i don''t think B&W was the better choice there! Your bokeh is good, but in my opinion it lost some "wow factor" without the colors! Nice photo though!', '2008-12-19 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140861, 747451, 99981, '<td valign="top">I love the colors an the bokeh..i just don''t like the distracting red spots.</td>', 'I love the colors an the bokeh..i just don''t like the distracting red spots.', '2008-12-19 12:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140962, 747263, 43774, '<td valign="top">The background is beautiful, so creamy, gorgeous colours too. Some might say there was too much neat image used but I like the smoothness of the petals.</td>', 'The background is beautiful, so creamy, gorgeous colours too. Some might say there was too much neat image used but I like the smoothness of the petals.', '2008-12-19 13:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140963, 747075, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, great close up, very nice.</td>', 'Very sharp, great close up, very nice.', '2008-12-19 13:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140964, 746956, 43774, '<td valign="top">Clever bokeh!!</td>', 'Clever bokeh!!', '2008-12-19 13:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140967, 747740, 43774, '<td valign="top">So pretty, very sharp and clear. Did you use a flash? Lighting looks a tad too artificial....just barely. But it''s a gorgeous photo.</td>', 'So pretty, very sharp and clear. Did you use a flash? Lighting looks a tad too artificial....just barely. But it''s a gorgeous photo.', '2008-12-19 13:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140968, 747742, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nise colours. I like that the bokeh is in the shape of an open leaf.</td>', 'Very nise colours. I like that the bokeh is in the shape of an open leaf.', '2008-12-19 13:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140970, 747957, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of the best Christmas ornament photos in the challenge (and there are a lot of them!).</td>', 'One of the best Christmas ornament photos in the challenge (and there are a lot of them!).', '2008-12-19 13:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140971, 747524, 43774, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful, light is exquisite.</td>', 'Just beautiful, light is exquisite.', '2008-12-19 13:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140972, 747240, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the bokeh. Would like to see a tad bit more DOF so the entire poinsettia was in focus.</td>', 'Love the colours and the bokeh. Would like to see a tad bit more DOF so the entire poinsettia was in focus.', '2008-12-19 13:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140974, 747835, 43774, '<td valign="top">So clear and colourful, a nice photo.</td>', 'So clear and colourful, a nice photo.', '2008-12-19 13:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140975, 747827, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a pretty ornament!!! Love the bokeh, it doesn''t overpower the delicate ornament.</td>', 'What a pretty ornament!!! Love the bokeh, it doesn''t overpower the delicate ornament.', '2008-12-19 13:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140978, 747250, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of the few shots with bokeh in the foreground and the best of those!</td>', 'One of the few shots with bokeh in the foreground and the best of those!', '2008-12-19 13:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140980, 746298, 43774, '<td valign="top">A colourful photo, nice, but the specks annoy me. Also wish it were cropped evenly on top and bottom. Perhaps I am too picky.</td>', 'A colourful photo, nice, but the specks annoy me. Also wish it were cropped evenly on top and bottom. Perhaps I am too picky.', '2008-12-19 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140981, 747389, 43774, '<td valign="top">Yummy looking, nice bokeh, cute Christmas-y and warm photo.</td>', 'Yummy looking, nice bokeh, cute Christmas-y and warm photo.', '2008-12-19 13:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140982, 748015, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF here, great colour.</td>', 'Very nice DOF here, great colour.', '2008-12-19 13:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140983, 747925, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty and delicate.</td>', 'Pretty and delicate.', '2008-12-19 13:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140984, 747977, 43774, '<td valign="top">So pretty, nice rich background colour.</td>', 'So pretty, nice rich background colour.', '2008-12-19 13:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140986, 747232, 43774, '<td valign="top">So cute in an ugly sort of way! Great composition.</td>', 'So cute in an ugly sort of way! Great composition.', '2008-12-19 13:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140988, 747923, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh so delicate and pretty, it''s like a Christmas whisper.</td>', 'Oh so delicate and pretty, it''s like a Christmas whisper.', '2008-12-19 13:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140989, 747011, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice and sparkly!</td>', 'Nice and sparkly!', '2008-12-19 13:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140992, 747750, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty, the reflected lights are nice. I might have left the hook off the ornament, it really doesn''t add anything to the photo.</td>', 'Pretty, the reflected lights are nice. I might have left the hook off the ornament, it really doesn''t add anything to the photo.', '2008-12-19 13:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140993, 747965, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, colourful photo, very clear and sharp.</td>', 'Nice DOF, colourful photo, very clear and sharp.', '2008-12-19 13:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140996, 748009, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice and soft/deliate looking. Feels like there is a bit too much empty space at the top.</td>', 'Nice and soft/deliate looking. Feels like there is a bit too much empty space at the top.', '2008-12-19 13:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5140997, 748024, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like this, great colours and super sharp and clear.</td>', 'I like this, great colours and super sharp and clear.', '2008-12-19 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141002, 747863, 43774, '<td valign="top">The flower seems out of focus yet oversharpened. I like the diagonal composition, the background and the colours.</td>', 'The flower seems out of focus yet oversharpened. I like the diagonal composition, the background and the colours.', '2008-12-19 13:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141004, 746521, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice looking birds, love that red eye. A good photo for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice looking birds, love that red eye. A good photo for this challenge.', '2008-12-19 13:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141005, 747902, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF here, could be a photo in a cooking magazine.</td>', 'Very good DOF here, could be a photo in a cooking magazine.', '2008-12-19 13:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141007, 747883, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF but would like to see this cropped a bit closer.</td>', 'Excellent DOF but would like to see this cropped a bit closer.', '2008-12-19 13:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141008, 747773, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, good colours. Would like to see a bit more DOF so the head of the butterfly is in focus like the wings are.</td>', 'Very clear, good colours. Would like to see a bit more DOF so the head of the butterfly is in focus like the wings are.', '2008-12-19 13:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141009, 747860, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, great colours, good bokeh.</td>', 'Very clear, great colours, good bokeh.', '2008-12-19 13:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141011, 747462, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, nice composition.</td>', 'Very clear, nice composition.', '2008-12-19 13:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141013, 746802, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty background, ornament is a bit dark.</td>', 'Pretty background, ornament is a bit dark.', '2008-12-19 13:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141034, 747923, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, beautiful colours.  Looks like it needs a bit more sharpness on the ornament holder (the blur there is distracting).  ~7</td>', 'Good idea, beautiful colours.  Looks like it needs a bit more sharpness on the ornament holder (the blur there is distracting).  ~7', '2008-12-19 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141037, 747924, 5112, '<td valign="top">I wish the sharpness were just a little further to the front, on the cat''s eye.  I like the way you framed the picture with the tail.  I also wish there were a bit more light on the cat''s face.  ~7</td>', 'I wish the sharpness were just a little further to the front, on the cat''s eye.  I like the way you framed the picture with the tail.  I also wish there were a bit more light on the cat''s face.  ~7', '2008-12-19 14:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141040, 747982, 5112, '<td valign="top">Caught!  Nice story.  I like the sense of motion.  ~7</td>', 'Caught!  Nice story.  I like the sense of motion.  ~7', '2008-12-19 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141042, 746893, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, pretty nice take.  Interesting composition, and interesting colours.  There is a(n annoying) greenish spot on the window closest to the viewer.  I like this.  ~8</td>', 'Wow, pretty nice take.  Interesting composition, and interesting colours.  There is a(n annoying) greenish spot on the window closest to the viewer.  I like this.  ~8', '2008-12-19 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141067, 747902, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yummy!  Russian tea cakes.  Love them, and the picture is beautiful, could go into a cook book.  ~8</td>', 'Yummy!  Russian tea cakes.  Love them, and the picture is beautiful, could go into a cook book.  ~8', '2008-12-19 14:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141072, 747689, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  I wish there was a little more space around the bird, especially at bottom and left (in front and below).  It looks a little cramped in this frame.  The image showcases the bird details much more so than the bokeh aspect of the image.  ~6</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  I wish there was a little more space around the bird, especially at bottom and left (in front and below).  It looks a little cramped in this frame.  The image showcases the bird details much more so than the bokeh aspect of the image.  ~6', '2008-12-19 14:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141075, 747736, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, a glow-in-the-dark spider!  Obviously your intent, going by the title :)  Good capture.  It''s hard to tell at this size, but focus seems to be right in front of the spider, not straight on it.  The out of focus droplets make for a beautiful frame for this spider.  ~7</td>', 'Ahhh, a glow-in-the-dark spider!  Obviously your intent, going by the title :)  Good capture.  It''s hard to tell at this size, but focus seems to be right in front of the spider, not straight on it.  The out of focus droplets make for a beautiful frame for this spider.  ~7', '2008-12-19 14:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141078, 747962, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lighting doesn''t really emphasize the pretty flowers enough</td>', 'the lighting doesn''t really emphasize the pretty flowers enough', '2008-12-19 14:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141079, 747138, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The fingertip needs to be a tad sharper though.  Maybe include just a little more of the face and a little less of the hand at right.  The red toys (??) at top are a distraction, and could be removed prior to shooting for a cleaner composition.  A cleaner compo of this might also look very good in black and white.  I think I would also try to remove the piece of blanket between the hand and the face, or put it further back, so it''s softer.  ~6</td>', 'Good idea.  The fingertip needs to be a tad sharper though.  Maybe include just a little more of the face and a little less of the hand at right.  The red toys (??) at top are a distraction, and could be removed prior to shooting for a cleaner composition.  A cleaner compo of this might also look very good in black and white.  I think I would also try to remove the piece of blanket between the hand and the face, or put it further back, so it''s softer.  ~6', '2008-12-19 14:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141080, 747011, 5112, '<td valign="top">One of the better ornament shot, the gold on gold is nice.  ~6</td>', 'One of the better ornament shot, the gold on gold is nice.  ~6', '2008-12-19 14:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141084, 746929, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice portrait of the ram - but the background is more distracting than enhancing to me</td>', 'nice portrait of the ram - but the background is more distracting than enhancing to me', '2008-12-19 14:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141086, 746285, 5112, '<td valign="top">This looks to me more like a long exposure image capitalizing on waterblur, rather than one where bokeh is strongly present and showcased.  The image is too small to appreciate really well, but I like the water, and the rocks, but not so much the pieces of rock intruding at bottom or the rather harsh artificial light.  It also feels a little like it might have too much empty space at right.  ~5</td>', 'This looks to me more like a long exposure image capitalizing on waterblur, rather than one where bokeh is strongly present and showcased.  The image is too small to appreciate really well, but I like the water, and the rocks, but not so much the pieces of rock intruding at bottom or the rather harsh artificial light.  It also feels a little like it might have too much empty space at right.  ~5', '2008-12-19 14:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141088, 747947, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I wish the light were a bit better (longer exposure maybe?).  ~6</td>', 'Good idea, I wish the light were a bit better (longer exposure maybe?).  ~6', '2008-12-19 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141091, 747524, 5112, '<td valign="top">If it were me, I think I would have trimmed a little off the top, to right above where the blue meets the pink area at left of the image.  The backlight brings out the beauty of the frozen branch very well, although maybe just a little hot in the middle.  ~6</td>', 'If it were me, I think I would have trimmed a little off the top, to right above where the blue meets the pink area at left of the image.  The backlight brings out the beauty of the frozen branch very well, although maybe just a little hot in the middle.  ~6', '2008-12-19 14:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
