(5141227, 747791, 97893, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. <br/> <br/>Additional comment: Somehow (it might be a matter of perception for me only), the eye in this picture travels from left to right, and it appears that if the left was in focus and the right blurred, it would have been more appealing.</td>', 'Nice picture.  Additional comment: Somehow (it might be a matter of perception for me only), the eye in this picture travels from left to right, and it appears that if the left was in focus and the right blurred, it would have been more appealing.', '2008-12-19 16:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141235, 747108, 96924, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but something does not work for me. The bird generates some expectation, but the bukeh does not supply the answer. I really like the bird. It seems like some story here. But something is unfinished. It would have been a great picture if the bukeh added to the story. Bukeh to me is not just a fuzzy background. It is a great way to enhance a picture and tell a story.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but something does not work for me. The bird generates some expectation, but the bukeh does not supply the answer. I really like the bird. It seems like some story here. But something is unfinished. It would have been a great picture if the bukeh added to the story. Bukeh to me is not just a fuzzy background. It is a great way to enhance a picture and tell a story.', '2008-12-19 16:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141239, 748029, 67152, '<td valign="top">i wish the ornament as the subject were better lit - the light circles overwhelm the shot</td>', 'i wish the ornament as the subject were better lit - the light circles overwhelm the shot', '2008-12-19 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
