(5142568, 747977, 99981, '<td valign="top">I can see some good bokeh on a part of the seeds, but this aspect is not present in all the composition...the front seed are kind of OOF and there are a brown distractive stain on the bottom. Love the border and the red background! Good luck!</td>', 'I can see some good bokeh on a part of the seeds, but this aspect is not present in all the composition...the front seed are kind of OOF and there are a brown distractive stain on the bottom. Love the border and the red background! Good luck!', '2008-12-20 11:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
