(5142608, 747598, 99981, '<td valign="top">I can''t see bokeh there..i can see a blurry object, with good colors and not well defined...but no bokeh. I''m sorry if i''m beeing rude, but i can''t see how your photo meets the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t see bokeh there..i can see a blurry object, with good colors and not well defined...but no bokeh. I''m sorry if i''m beeing rude, but i can''t see how your photo meets the challenge.', '2008-12-20 12:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
