(5142649, 748039, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the bokeh but i''m not sure if the B&amp;W was the right option in this challenge! Showing the color of the eyes of the kid would be great! The left part of his face is kind of OOF but your photo is really good in my opinion!</td>', 'I like the bokeh but i''m not sure if the B&W was the right option in this challenge! Showing the color of the eyes of the kid would be great! The left part of his face is kind of OOF but your photo is really good in my opinion!', '2008-12-20 12:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
