(5142658, 747922, 99981, '<td valign="top">The black part at the right top distracts me but you got a nice bokeh there! Maybe getting just one of those brown things (don''t know how to call it) would be a good idea, because the other one without focus seems to be unnecessary. Good photo!</td>', 'The black part at the right top distracts me but you got a nice bokeh there! Maybe getting just one of those brown things (don''t know how to call it) would be a good idea, because the other one without focus seems to be unnecessary. Good photo!', '2008-12-20 12:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
