(5142688, 747531, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well, i can''t see a good bokeh there and no foreground and background well defined...But the colors are good!</td>', 'Well, i can''t see a good bokeh there and no foreground and background well defined...But the colors are good!', '2008-12-20 12:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142690, 746244, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well...i''m sorry but i''m giving you 1 on this photo. The objet almost doesn''t exist and your photo is just the black "background" at the and. I see no sign of bokeh there. Sorry if i was rude but this doesn''t meet the challenge for me.</td>', 'Well...i''m sorry but i''m giving you 1 on this photo. The objet almost doesn''t exist and your photo is just the black "background" at the and. I see no sign of bokeh there. Sorry if i was rude but this doesn''t meet the challenge for me.', '2008-12-20 12:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142691, 747011, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great colors and nice bokeh! I can almost forget it''s another christmas theme! Great photo!</td>', 'Great colors and nice bokeh! I can almost forget it''s another christmas theme! Great photo!', '2008-12-20 12:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142695, 747659, 99981, '<td valign="top">Heheh! So cool! It made me laugh! It could be with more focus and better lights! The bokeh isn''t really cool too, but your idea rocks! I''m sure you can do better with your creativity!</td>', 'Heheh! So cool! It made me laugh! It could be with more focus and better lights! The bokeh isn''t really cool too, but your idea rocks! I''m sure you can do better with your creativity!', '2008-12-20 12:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142697, 746521, 99981, '<td valign="top">That''s great! Beatiful bokeh! Beautiful objects! Outstanding!!! One of my favorites!</td>', 'That''s great! Beatiful bokeh! Beautiful objects! Outstanding!!! One of my favorites!', '2008-12-20 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142702, 747530, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great colors and good bokeh! The cat seems to be a little OOF but i really like it!</td>', 'Great colors and good bokeh! The cat seems to be a little OOF but i really like it!', '2008-12-20 12:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142706, 747808, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of cell phones in photos but you were very creative! Did you use a window to fix this phone in this position? Well...great bokeh and great photo!</td>', 'I''m not a fan of cell phones in photos but you were very creative! Did you use a window to fix this phone in this position? Well...great bokeh and great photo!', '2008-12-20 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142707, 747726, 99981, '<td valign="top">What about the pink border? Heheh...really girly! The object is really well focused, with great colors and i loved your bokeh! I believe in a top 10 for this. I think that with your good technique you could have a better idea for the next challenge..Flowers, so as the christmas themes are kind of too normal in this challenge! But i have to say that you broke the common with a nice composition!</td>', 'What about the pink border? Heheh...really girly! The object is really well focused, with great colors and i loved your bokeh! I believe in a top 10 for this. I think that with your good technique you could have a better idea for the next challenge..Flowers, so as the christmas themes are kind of too normal in this challenge! But i have to say that you broke the common with a nice composition!', '2008-12-20 12:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142712, 747108, 99981, '<td valign="top">He looks like a spy there, heheh! <br/>What can i say about that? Amazing? Great? 10?<br/>Beatiful color and great bokeh! Elegant border! This may be a top 10.</td>', 'He looks like a spy there, heheh! What can i say about that? Amazing? Great? 10?Beatiful color and great bokeh! Elegant border! This may be a top 10.', '2008-12-20 13:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142731, 748036, 98022, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but the ornament is a little too dark IMHO. It may have been better to have more lighting on the ornament to make it stand out more from the background.</td>', 'Good shot, but the ornament is a little too dark IMHO. It may have been better to have more lighting on the ornament to make it stand out more from the background.', '2008-12-20 13:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142733, 746946, 70375, '<td valign="top">Well, to start, I''ll say that your light is interesting. An interesting use of foreground bokeh as well. Your overall composition is a bit boring. There is really nothing there to catch attention. Perhaps if there were certain keys that were in the focal plane, it would be a bit better. It just seems uninspired. Your focus is a bit soft as well. When I see a photo, I search for a focal point where the subject can be studied. This leaves me a bit lost in the frame. Perhaps a higher DOF would have worked here to bring more of the bg into focus. Anyway, good luck in the challenge. :)</td>', 'Well, to start, I''ll say that your light is interesting. An interesting use of foreground bokeh as well. Your overall composition is a bit boring. There is really nothing there to catch attention. Perhaps if there were certain keys that were in the focal plane, it would be a bit better. It just seems uninspired. Your focus is a bit soft as well. When I see a photo, I search for a focal point where the subject can be studied. This leaves me a bit lost in the frame. Perhaps a higher DOF would have worked here to bring more of the bg into focus. Anyway, good luck in the challenge. :)', '2008-12-20 13:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142738, 747924, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your soft window lighting is pretty. I think this could have been improved greatly if the cat were looking at the camera though. The way it is, I almost can''t tell it is a cat unless I read the title. Your focus is very crisp on the head/ear. There is something yellow in the middle right of the photograph that takes my attention away though. I believe that some of the best cat photographs are setups and you seem to have a willing model so keep shooting what you love. I hope this helped a little. Good luck :)</td>', 'Your soft window lighting is pretty. I think this could have been improved greatly if the cat were looking at the camera though. The way it is, I almost can''t tell it is a cat unless I read the title. Your focus is very crisp on the head/ear. There is something yellow in the middle right of the photograph that takes my attention away though. I believe that some of the best cat photographs are setups and you seem to have a willing model so keep shooting what you love. I hope this helped a little. Good luck :)', '2008-12-20 13:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142748, 746907, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your focus is great. I find that the dog so tightly fitted into the frame does not do the game he is playing justice. In order to convey a sense of fun, you really have to have a sense of movement and energy. This might have been achieved by panning out on the shot a bit to capture more of the dog in the frame so we can see what he is doing and positioning him on the right side of the frame to give him something to move into. This would have been a good place to use a little fill flash as well. It would have enabled you to balance the shadows in the front with the light in the back. While his face is properly exposed, the back of his head, his back, and some of the light in the bg is blown out. Good luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Your focus is great. I find that the dog so tightly fitted into the frame does not do the game he is playing justice. In order to convey a sense of fun, you really have to have a sense of movement and energy. This might have been achieved by panning out on the shot a bit to capture more of the dog in the frame so we can see what he is doing and positioning him on the right side of the frame to give him something to move into. This would have been a good place to use a little fill flash as well. It would have enabled you to balance the shadows in the front with the light in the back. While his face is properly exposed, the back of his head, his back, and some of the light in the bg is blown out. Good luck in the challenge :)', '2008-12-20 13:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142750, 748037, 70375, '<td valign="top">When I looked at this, my first reaction was, "ouch!" :) I think that your composition here would have been greatly improved by moving the camera up just a bit to only capture the tips of the spikes in front and leaving the plant in back to fully take up the rest of the frame. As it is now, I have a hard time finding your control of the situation. It seems to be everywhere at once. Your focus on the plant in front is good though. Sometimes, less is more. Good luck! :)</td>', 'When I looked at this, my first reaction was, "ouch!" :) I think that your composition here would have been greatly improved by moving the camera up just a bit to only capture the tips of the spikes in front and leaving the plant in back to fully take up the rest of the frame. As it is now, I have a hard time finding your control of the situation. It seems to be everywhere at once. Your focus on the plant in front is good though. Sometimes, less is more. Good luck! :)', '2008-12-20 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142755, 747619, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your bokeh is lovely. But, unless taking a portrait, it is rarely a good idea to center your subject. Seating this one on the left would have been a better choice. I don''t care for the bright red frame, black or gray would have been a better choice here, IMO. If you had cropped it closer to the left hand side, it would have given the viewer a chance to be led to the ornament by the branch on the right. The snow on the ornament is a bit blown out. Your lighting would have been much more interesting had you taken the brightness down a bit or sped up your shutter when photographing the ornament. This has a lot of potential and shows creativity, which is good. Very nicely focused as well. Good luck! :)</td>', 'Your bokeh is lovely. But, unless taking a portrait, it is rarely a good idea to center your subject. Seating this one on the left would have been a better choice. I don''t care for the bright red frame, black or gray would have been a better choice here, IMO. If you had cropped it closer to the left hand side, it would have given the viewer a chance to be led to the ornament by the branch on the right. The snow on the ornament is a bit blown out. Your lighting would have been much more interesting had you taken the brightness down a bit or sped up your shutter when photographing the ornament. This has a lot of potential and shows creativity, which is good. Very nicely focused as well. Good luck! :)', '2008-12-20 13:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142761, 747777, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your bokeh is nice but your foreground choice really does very little for this image. Perhaps one of those lovely flowers in the background would have made for a better subject because I can''t see how the tree relates to the flowers and it''s texture is distracting from the shapes they are making. However, your focus is good and your light is very nice. I do appreciate that you didn''t blow out the sky. It has a beautiful blue colour which works very well with the pink in the blooms. Just remember it all comes down to composition and to find things that compliment each other in the frame. Good luck! :)</td>', 'Your bokeh is nice but your foreground choice really does very little for this image. Perhaps one of those lovely flowers in the background would have made for a better subject because I can''t see how the tree relates to the flowers and it''s texture is distracting from the shapes they are making. However, your focus is good and your light is very nice. I do appreciate that you didn''t blow out the sky. It has a beautiful blue colour which works very well with the pink in the blooms. Just remember it all comes down to composition and to find things that compliment each other in the frame. Good luck! :)', '2008-12-20 13:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142767, 747773, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your butterfly is beautiful and I believe she would have been enhanced greatly if you had a bit deeper DOF here. While her wings are in very good focus, her whole body is not and I think that is hurting this image a bit. Also, giving this a bit more headroom might have been a better choice. It would have given us a better area of bokeh and placed her better within the frame. As it is now, it <i>looks</i> like you tried to center her but failed. Your leading line takes me right into the photograph and then right back out. Maybe a crop to take it out totally. I am a big sucker for butterflies though :) Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your butterfly is beautiful and I believe she would have been enhanced greatly if you had a bit deeper DOF here. While her wings are in very good focus, her whole body is not and I think that is hurting this image a bit. Also, giving this a bit more headroom might have been a better choice. It would have given us a better area of bokeh and placed her better within the frame. As it is now, it looks like you tried to center her but failed. Your leading line takes me right into the photograph and then right back out. Maybe a crop to take it out totally. I am a big sucker for butterflies though :) Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-12-20 13:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142778, 747714, 89230, '<td valign="top">quite nice photo. I think you made the front page. Good luck/congrats!</td>', 'quite nice photo. I think you made the front page. Good luck/congrats!', '2008-12-20 13:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142780, 747919, 89230, '<td valign="top">What a great idea. I do think that it would be more appealing if the ashtray was in the bottom 1/3 in the corner. Maybe pan to see more of the pub?</td>', 'What a great idea. I do think that it would be more appealing if the ashtray was in the bottom 1/3 in the corner. Maybe pan to see more of the pub?', '2008-12-20 13:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
