(5142906, 747621, 85102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. My one complaint is the yellowish fuzzyness in the bottom. I know with basic editing of course you can''t clone it out, but that''s the only thing keeping me from bumping your score higher...</td>', 'Beautiful shot. My one complaint is the yellowish fuzzyness in the bottom. I know with basic editing of course you can''t clone it out, but that''s the only thing keeping me from bumping your score higher...', '2008-12-20 15:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
