(5142980, 748040, 93756, '<td valign="top">I''ll be really curious to read your explanation of why you choose such a large black border. Neat way to frame the photo on your wall, but it does make it difficult to vote on the pic. Looks like a neat photo. Very hard to decide what to vote on this one...</td>', 'I''ll be really curious to read your explanation of why you choose such a large black border. Neat way to frame the photo on your wall, but it does make it difficult to vote on the pic. Looks like a neat photo. Very hard to decide what to vote on this one...', '2008-12-20 16:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
