(5143043, 747946, 85849, '<td valign="top">I really like this as a bokeh shot. The red and yellow colors really work and there''s enough detail to see that the bokeh is made up of even more of these little buds.</td>', 'I really like this as a bokeh shot. The red and yellow colors really work and there''s enough detail to see that the bokeh is made up of even more of these little buds.', '2008-12-20 17:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
