(5143052, 747619, 99981, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like the border and the theme is not really interesting! But the colors and the bokeh (which is the most important) are great!</td>', 'I didn''t like the border and the theme is not really interesting! But the colors and the bokeh (which is the most important) are great!', '2008-12-20 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
