(5143057, 747860, 85849, '<td valign="top">WOW! OK I''ve seen one shot that I predicted a ribbon for. This is one of the best bokeh shots I''ve ever seen! We''re into winter here. I envy you the scenery and I also predict a blue ribbon!</td>', 'WOW! OK I''ve seen one shot that I predicted a ribbon for. This is one of the best bokeh shots I''ve ever seen! We''re into winter here. I envy you the scenery and I also predict a blue ribbon!', '2008-12-20 17:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
