(5143830, 747105, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful holiday shot! Nice use of DoF. I like how the reflections on the table are blurred just as the background. Nice composition and styling.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful holiday shot! Nice use of DoF. I like how the reflections on the table are blurred just as the background. Nice composition and styling.', '2008-12-21 11:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
