(5143901, 747921, 99981, '<td valign="top">Your photo is great...the composition, the idea and the light, almost everything good! But in my opinion this is not a good bokeh, because the background (which in this case is the guy) is well sharpened, and this is not a good thing in bokeh. The glass as the foreground is great, maybe more distance between the guy and the window would make this shot the best of this challenge!</td>', 'Your photo is great...the composition, the idea and the light, almost everything good! But in my opinion this is not a good bokeh, because the background (which in this case is the guy) is well sharpened, and this is not a good thing in bokeh. The glass as the foreground is great, maybe more distance between the guy and the window would make this shot the best of this challenge!', '2008-12-21 11:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143904, 746298, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great colors! Beautiful shot! Good bokeh!</td>', 'Great colors! Beautiful shot! Good bokeh!', '2008-12-21 11:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
