(5144758, 746461, 27514, '<td valign="top">lighting is not the best but what a rare catch.</td>', 'lighting is not the best but what a rare catch.', '2008-12-21 19:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144763, 746285, 27514, '<td valign="top">lighting is about 5 min from being perfect, look at the highlight on top of the rock formation. Size is also kind of small so I can''t really tell for sure but seems not in focus to me. Also landscape work doesn''t really fit in the bokeh theme. <br/> <br/>Nice image though, I would like to see it bigger and 5 min later or ealier depending on if this was an a.m. or p.m. exposure</td>', 'lighting is about 5 min from being perfect, look at the highlight on top of the rock formation. Size is also kind of small so I can''t really tell for sure but seems not in focus to me. Also landscape work doesn''t really fit in the bokeh theme.  Nice image though, I would like to see it bigger and 5 min later or ealier depending on if this was an a.m. or p.m. exposure', '2008-12-21 19:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144768, 747894, 27514, '<td valign="top">lighting is decent but I have seen this done better. I''m not one of these guys that say everything has to be "new" to be good, and I really support you for trying to remake a nice image but if you do try to do that you have to be just as good if not better in you lighting.</td>', 'lighting is decent but I have seen this done better. I''m not one of these guys that say everything has to be "new" to be good, and I really support you for trying to remake a nice image but if you do try to do that you have to be just as good if not better in you lighting.', '2008-12-21 20:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144770, 747240, 27514, '<td valign="top">oversaturated</td>', 'oversaturated', '2008-12-21 20:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144771, 748029, 27514, '<td valign="top">underexposed, front orniment is very dark</td>', 'underexposed, front orniment is very dark', '2008-12-21 20:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144772, 747858, 27514, '<td valign="top">the "circles of confusion" kind of keep this one down from 8 or 9 for me. I''ll give it a 7 though</td>', 'the "circles of confusion" kind of keep this one down from 8 or 9 for me. I''ll give it a 7 though', '2008-12-21 20:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144776, 747924, 27514, '<td valign="top">I enjoy these muted colors. Reminds me of a better time in photography when everything didn''t have to be "new and flashy" to be good.</td>', 'I enjoy these muted colors. Reminds me of a better time in photography when everything didn''t have to be "new and flashy" to be good.', '2008-12-21 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
