(5144850, 747987, 80458, '<td valign="top">i think your dof is a little TOO small in this shot.</td>', 'i think your dof is a little TOO small in this shot.', '2008-12-21 21:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144857, 747355, 80458, '<td valign="top">clever!!</td>', 'clever!!', '2008-12-21 21:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144873, 747858, 88580, '<td valign="top">This one makes me want to come back to look at it again and again.  The composition is outstanding--you can''t go wrong with a strong diagonal IMO.  The colors are soft and pleasing to the eye.  And there''s just enough sharp detail to make it interesting to view.</td>', 'This one makes me want to come back to look at it again and again.  The composition is outstanding--you can''t go wrong with a strong diagonal IMO.  The colors are soft and pleasing to the eye.  And there''s just enough sharp detail to make it interesting to view.', '2008-12-21 21:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144887, 747159, 62925, '<td valign="top">nice attempt, but you need something to be in focus in this image for it to be visually appealing</td>', 'nice attempt, but you need something to be in focus in this image for it to be visually appealing', '2008-12-21 21:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144910, 746967, 99981, '<td valign="top">Good choice for the B&amp;W and good portrait! But i don''t see a nice bokeh there, doesn''t meet the challenge in my opinion! Sorry if i was rude, i loved the photo!</td>', 'Good choice for the B&W and good portrait! But i don''t see a nice bokeh there, doesn''t meet the challenge in my opinion! Sorry if i was rude, i loved the photo!', '2008-12-21 21:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144915, 748035, 99981, '<td valign="top">The flowers could have more focus, but the colors are great and i like the bokeh, despite it isn''t appearing so much. Maybe another perspective would be better.</td>', 'The flowers could have more focus, but the colors are great and i like the bokeh, despite it isn''t appearing so much. Maybe another perspective would be better.', '2008-12-21 21:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144918, 746857, 99981, '<td valign="top">hehe, great effect! There is too much white space with nothing and i would like to see more of those front sticks, which are the main ones, right? Good bokeh and beatiful photo!</td>', 'hehe, great effect! There is too much white space with nothing and i would like to see more of those front sticks, which are the main ones, right? Good bokeh and beatiful photo!', '2008-12-21 22:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144921, 747738, 99981, '<td valign="top">Woa! Beatiful! Nice bokeh and great details!</td>', 'Woa! Beatiful! Nice bokeh and great details!', '2008-12-21 22:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144926, 747883, 99981, '<td valign="top">Your photo is greally cool! I love the leafs colors and the perspective. The bokeh could be better in my opinion, but its a good shot!</td>', 'Your photo is greally cool! I love the leafs colors and the perspective. The bokeh could be better in my opinion, but its a good shot!', '2008-12-21 22:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144933, 747869, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great! The bug seems just a little OOF but the light and the bokeh makes me feel really calm, eheh! Those things make your photo look so amazing!</td>', 'Great! The bug seems just a little OOF but the light and the bokeh makes me feel really calm, eheh! Those things make your photo look so amazing!', '2008-12-21 22:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144940, 747613, 99981, '<td valign="top">The colors and the object you got there are great! The bokeh is ok, but it''s more tough or hard than soft and creamy in my opinion.</td>', 'The colors and the object you got there are great! The bokeh is ok, but it''s more tough or hard than soft and creamy in my opinion.', '2008-12-21 22:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144948, 747329, 99981, '<td valign="top">The colors are beatiful but your photo have some bad things in my opinion. The light on the top is too distractive and the reflex on the ball too. About the bokeh, i think the background it''s kind of blurry and the lights are unnecessary because they are too strong and distractive too. Maybe more speed would finish all this problems. Sorry if i was rude, it wasn''t my intention. Nice try! Good luck!</td>', 'The colors are beatiful but your photo have some bad things in my opinion. The light on the top is too distractive and the reflex on the ball too. About the bokeh, i think the background it''s kind of blurry and the lights are unnecessary because they are too strong and distractive too. Maybe more speed would finish all this problems. Sorry if i was rude, it wasn''t my intention. Nice try! Good luck!', '2008-12-21 22:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144956, 747215, 99981, '<td valign="top">I had a problem to comment your photo...I like the effect on the leafs, and there is a good bokeh on the right, but i think the left part isn''t on focus, and this (in my opinion) makes your photo a confusion, like the title (which is good by the way). I think you would have more success with another perspective.</td>', 'I had a problem to comment your photo...I like the effect on the leafs, and there is a good bokeh on the right, but i think the left part isn''t on focus, and this (in my opinion) makes your photo a confusion, like the title (which is good by the way). I think you would have more success with another perspective.', '2008-12-21 22:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144960, 748004, 99981, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different connection between the background and the cat was going to be great. Imagine milk dropping or something like that. He is a little OOF too, but you did good with the bokeh. I think we made the same mistake in this challenge. I know the circles of light are not necessary for bokeh, but i really thought it would be great with any object, but it''s not. The cat in the photo doesn''t have a connection to the circles of light, nice try though! Let''s keep trying, hehe!</td>', 'Maybe a different connection between the background and the cat was going to be great. Imagine milk dropping or something like that. He is a little OOF too, but you did good with the bokeh. I think we made the same mistake in this challenge. I know the circles of light are not necessary for bokeh, but i really thought it would be great with any object, but it''s not. The cat in the photo doesn''t have a connection to the circles of light, nice try though! Let''s keep trying, hehe!', '2008-12-21 22:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144961, 747985, 99981, '<td valign="top">The silhouette is great, but i''m not convinced with the bokeh. Your photo is noisy too, but it was a great idea, it''s just missing some tweak.</td>', 'The silhouette is great, but i''m not convinced with the bokeh. Your photo is noisy too, but it was a great idea, it''s just missing some tweak.', '2008-12-21 22:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144963, 747973, 99981, '<td valign="top">Her hands as a silhouette doesn''t show me a good bokeh and she is OOF as the background. I didn''t like the choice for B&amp;W too, but i think your idea is cool. Sorry if i was rude! Good luck!</td>', 'Her hands as a silhouette doesn''t show me a good bokeh and she is OOF as the background. I didn''t like the choice for B&W too, but i think your idea is cool. Sorry if i was rude! Good luck!', '2008-12-21 22:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144965, 747250, 99981, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh! You missed some points with me because of the christmas theme, but i like this shot, the lights, colors, really cool. The statue could be closer too, it''s hard to see what it is. <br/>I like the border too, really elegant.</td>', 'Nice bokeh! You missed some points with me because of the christmas theme, but i like this shot, the lights, colors, really cool. The statue could be closer too, it''s hard to see what it is. I like the border too, really elegant.', '2008-12-21 22:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144966, 746336, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh with nice colors! The flower could be more focused and brighter!</td>', 'Great bokeh with nice colors! The flower could be more focused and brighter!', '2008-12-21 22:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144970, 748008, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but the crop cut some parts of the dancer and the bokeh is good but not really creamy. Great colors!</td>', 'I like this photo but the crop cut some parts of the dancer and the bokeh is good but not really creamy. Great colors!', '2008-12-21 22:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144973, 746677, 99981, '<td valign="top">The beetle is a little OOF and could have more details. The bokeh is not really good because the background is too well sharpened. With more adjustments you would have an amazing shot there.</td>', 'The beetle is a little OOF and could have more details. The bokeh is not really good because the background is too well sharpened. With more adjustments you would have an amazing shot there.', '2008-12-21 22:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144975, 747784, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good bokeh! I just think you tried a silhouette but the guy have some lighten parts on his neck, which is not really cool. Next time try to put him with more distance and try to show more of his body, there are some parts like his right shoulder and the right part of his head that should be included on the silhouette in my opinion. Nice shot!</td>', 'Great idea and good bokeh! I just think you tried a silhouette but the guy have some lighten parts on his neck, which is not really cool. Next time try to put him with more distance and try to show more of his body, there are some parts like his right shoulder and the right part of his head that should be included on the silhouette in my opinion. Nice shot!', '2008-12-21 22:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144978, 747791, 99981, '<td valign="top">I would like colors and a better bokeh on this photo, because i really like your idea. Nice shot.</td>', 'I would like colors and a better bokeh on this photo, because i really like your idea. Nice shot.', '2008-12-21 22:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144979, 747914, 99981, '<td valign="top">Wow! More focus on the branch and a closer look at this water drop and this photo would be perfect! Nice bokeh!</td>', 'Wow! More focus on the branch and a closer look at this water drop and this photo would be perfect! Nice bokeh!', '2008-12-21 22:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144980, 747660, 99981, '<td valign="top">I think the background is too dark and have some distractive points, like the upper part, where is a part of the roof or something. I''m not sure about this bokeh, but it looks more blurry than bokeh for me. Sorry if i was rude.</td>', 'I think the background is too dark and have some distractive points, like the upper part, where is a part of the roof or something. I''m not sure about this bokeh, but it looks more blurry than bokeh for me. Sorry if i was rude.', '2008-12-21 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144997, 748027, 99981, '<td valign="top">I had some hard times to decide what is my vote and my comment to your photo. But let''s go...The theme is not interesting, because it''s really obvious, like others at this challenge, which you lose some points in my opinion. The title is obvious too, but i wish you the same! The main object is really dark and the background looks a little dark too, but in other way, the santa  looks great in terms of lighting. There are some parts of this photo that shows me good bokeh, but in resume, i have the impression that your shot is more blurry than Bokeh. Nice try though, and i may be wrong, but it''s my opinion in this subjective challenge. Good luck and again...Merry christmas for you too.</td>', 'I had some hard times to decide what is my vote and my comment to your photo. But let''s go...The theme is not interesting, because it''s really obvious, like others at this challenge, which you lose some points in my opinion. The title is obvious too, but i wish you the same! The main object is really dark and the background looks a little dark too, but in other way, the santa  looks great in terms of lighting. There are some parts of this photo that shows me good bokeh, but in resume, i have the impression that your shot is more blurry than Bokeh. Nice try though, and i may be wrong, but it''s my opinion in this subjective challenge. Good luck and again...Merry christmas for you too.', '2008-12-21 23:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5145003, 747946, 99981, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color! There could be much focus here in the front, but the bokeh at the background is great!</td>', 'Beautiful color! There could be much focus here in the front, but the bokeh at the background is great!', '2008-12-21 23:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
