(5145885, 747963, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the B&amp;W was a good choice, i''m very confused with the tree because it''s blurry for me, not a bokeh. The snow falling is really beautiful and i don''t know how you did it, but this doesn''t make me feel like i''m looking at a bokeh photo.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the B&W was a good choice, i''m very confused with the tree because it''s blurry for me, not a bokeh. The snow falling is really beautiful and i don''t know how you did it, but this doesn''t make me feel like i''m looking at a bokeh photo.', '2008-12-22 09:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5145889, 747956, 99981, '<td valign="top">The little old man is OOF i the colors are ok, but kind of dead in my opinion. The bokeh is ok too, but the theme and the composition really didn''t convince me. Sorry if i was rude! Good luck!</td>', 'The little old man is OOF i the colors are ok, but kind of dead in my opinion. The bokeh is ok too, but the theme and the composition really didn''t convince me. Sorry if i was rude! Good luck!', '2008-12-22 09:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5145899, 747750, 99981, '<td valign="top">The reflex on the table is really cool! There is a orange light there, i really like it! It''s all right! The colors, the object and the bokeh are cool for me, i just don''t like the theme, because i think it was too obvious that would be a lot of christmas themes in this challenge, and it doesn''t sound really creative for me. But this is just a detail, i like your shot and it is not my intention to be rude, just giving my opinion! Good luck!</td>', 'The reflex on the table is really cool! There is a orange light there, i really like it! It''s all right! The colors, the object and the bokeh are cool for me, i just don''t like the theme, because i think it was too obvious that would be a lot of christmas themes in this challenge, and it doesn''t sound really creative for me. But this is just a detail, i like your shot and it is not my intention to be rude, just giving my opinion! Good luck!', '2008-12-22 09:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5145916, 747705, 99981, '<td valign="top">Heheh! The color is great, but maybe too strong! The upper part of the leaf whick is OOF is kind of distractive, but i really like the bokeh! Good shot!</td>', 'Heheh! The color is great, but maybe too strong! The upper part of the leaf whick is OOF is kind of distractive, but i really like the bokeh! Good shot!', '2008-12-22 09:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
