(5145952, 747987, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well, i see some creamy aspects in your photo, but i don''t see a focused object in detach... The colors are great too! Just try to give preference to some object next time...it''s just a flower with blurry and maybe bokeh consistence. Sorry if i was rude! Good luck!</td>', 'Well, i see some creamy aspects in your photo, but i don''t see a focused object in detach... The colors are great too! Just try to give preference to some object next time...it''s just a flower with blurry and maybe bokeh consistence. Sorry if i was rude! Good luck!', '2008-12-22 09:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
