(5145970, 747857, 99981, '<td valign="top">The colors seems kind of dead for me...I don''t see a good bokeh there, because the background is already unsharpened, because it looks like a painted wall or something. Try more focus and a different background next time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-27 21:27:14.</i></td>', 'The colors seems kind of dead for me...I don''t see a good bokeh there, because the background is already unsharpened, because it looks like a painted wall or something. Try more focus and a different background next time.', '2008-12-22 10:03:29.000000', '2008-12-27 21:27:14.000000', 1),
(5145976, 747551, 99981, '<td valign="top">The background is great, you cut some parts of the flower and it''s OOF, which is not good. Try to show all the object next time, a bigger part of the background and more focus and you''ll have a great photo in my opinion! Good luck!</td>', 'The background is great, you cut some parts of the flower and it''s OOF, which is not good. Try to show all the object next time, a bigger part of the background and more focus and you''ll have a great photo in my opinion! Good luck!', '2008-12-22 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
