(5148728, 746461, 69325, '<td valign="top">I said it before and I''ll say it again, Roz is to bugs as Irene is to waterdrops.<br/>Everyone say hello to a new heavyweight. I can say I knew you when! Good job babe!<br/> <br/><b>p.s. you know you''ve arrived when people start guessing who the photographer is by the shot during voring!</b><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-24 00:18:37.</i></td>', 'I said it before and I''ll say it again, Roz is to bugs as Irene is to waterdrops.Everyone say hello to a new heavyweight. I can say I knew you when! Good job babe! p.s. you know you''ve arrived when people start guessing who the photographer is by the shot during voring!', '2008-12-24 00:16:17.000000', '2008-12-24 00:18:37.000000', 0),
(5148734, 747860, 79955, '<td valign="top">Woohoo! congrats ernie!!</td>', 'Woohoo! congrats ernie!!', '2008-12-24 00:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5148736, 747735, 70375, '<td valign="top">Hi hon :) Try <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> tutorial on how to resize your images for DPC :) I hope this helps :)</td>', 'Hi hon :) Try this tutorial on how to resize your images for DPC :) I hope this helps :)', '2008-12-24 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5148740, 747075, 85849, '<td valign="top">WOW! I wanted to improve from my last score, but I had no expectation of a top ten. Thanks for all the votes and comments. This is one of my two favorite bird feeders to visit in the winter. It paid off this day even though it was -20C and I was sitting in the snow.</td>', 'WOW! I wanted to improve from my last score, but I had no expectation of a top ten. Thanks for all the votes and comments. This is one of my two favorite bird feeders to visit in the winter. It paid off this day even though it was -20C and I was sitting in the snow.', '2008-12-24 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5148742, 747232, 42601, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by K10DGuy:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s official.  Frogs are the new water drops. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And theyre so much cooler! <br/> <br/>Congratulations on the red! Spectacular shot!</td>', 'Originally posted by K10DGuy: It''s official.  Frogs are the new water drops.   And theyre so much cooler!  Congratulations on the red! Spectacular shot!', '2008-12-24 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
