(5148804, 747858, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of your work (so far) for the perfect control of your shot, for an excellent abstract with lovely color, for the way it holds my interest.  Well done.</td>', 'This is my favorite of your work (so far) for the perfect control of your shot, for an excellent abstract with lovely color, for the way it holds my interest.  Well done.', '2008-12-24 00:52:14.000000', NULL, 0),
