(5148905, 746461, 60915, '<td valign="top">So glad to see you with another well deserved blue ribbon, Roz! One of the most passionate photographers on this site, I reckon! It''s been a real pleasure to watch you develop your skills and style. Big congrats to you! : )</td>', 'So glad to see you with another well deserved blue ribbon, Roz! One of the most passionate photographers on this site, I reckon! It''s been a real pleasure to watch you develop your skills and style. Big congrats to you! : )', '2008-12-24 01:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5148907, 747062, 60173, '<td valign="top">I can see where you''d call the water texture bokeh, and I really like it.<br/> <br/>You can actually clone out sensor dust in Basic, but you might have a hard time convincing the council that those spots are sensor dust.<br/> <br/>"No selections or spot editing tools are allowed, with the sole exception of cloning out sensor dust or hot pixels."<br/> <br/>There is some weirdness going on with the edges of your leaf. I can''t tell if it''s oversharpening or if it''s a compression issue, but you''ve got the jaggies and the top edge has some unnatural looking red.<br/></td>', 'I can see where you''d call the water texture bokeh, and I really like it. You can actually clone out sensor dust in Basic, but you might have a hard time convincing the council that those spots are sensor dust. "No selections or spot editing tools are allowed, with the sole exception of cloning out sensor dust or hot pixels." There is some weirdness going on with the edges of your leaf. I can''t tell if it''s oversharpening or if it''s a compression issue, but you''ve got the jaggies and the top edge has some unnatural looking red.', '2008-12-24 01:38:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5148908, 747553, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  You were one of my 2 9s in the end. Thanks for the slideshow, too.  Way too cool.  I think this would look great as a huge print.</td>', 'Very nice.  You were one of my 2 9s in the end. Thanks for the slideshow, too.  Way too cool.  I think this would look great as a huge print.', '2008-12-24 01:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
