(5152182, 747984, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oooo, this is gorgeous. I love the rich red and other colors -- so many of them. And the light is really nice too. I hate those "busy" comments. I like the composition and the stimulation I get from all the light points. I don''t need someone to isolate the subject for me. This is a real Color Carnival.</td>', 'Oooo, this is gorgeous. I love the rich red and other colors -- so many of them. And the light is really nice too. I hate those "busy" comments. I like the composition and the stimulation I get from all the light points. I don''t need someone to isolate the subject for me. This is a real Color Carnival.', '2008-12-26 16:31:54.000000', NULL, 0),
