(5154578, 747553, 53316, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sense of motion!</td>', 'Dramatic sense of motion!', '2008-12-28 08:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5154581, 747923, 53316, '<td valign="top">WOW. Wow wow wow. This to me is so amazing in the same way than a photo of a barely dressed body can be more enticing to many people than the same one fully undressed...  I have never seen an orniment depected in this way (mostly hidden) and it truly is fantastic.  In addition to the concept being brilliant, the execution is flawless. Great DOF, colors, and composition.  You should be very proud of this image!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-28 17:08:10.</i></td>', 'WOW. Wow wow wow. This to me is so amazing in the same way than a photo of a barely dressed body can be more enticing to many people than the same one fully undressed...  I have never seen an orniment depected in this way (mostly hidden) and it truly is fantastic.  In addition to the concept being brilliant, the execution is flawless. Great DOF, colors, and composition.  You should be very proud of this image!', '2008-12-28 08:10:36.000000', '2008-12-28 17:08:10.000000', 0),
