(7227135, 747603, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken almost exactly the same image! I don''t know if you had any trouble with focusing, but it was a bugger for me. The breeze was blowing the limb around, so I couldn''t manually focus or auto focus. I think your results are better than what I came up with. I like that you can see other branches, thick with ice, in the background. Hey, I now see that was the challenge, so great job, heh.</td>', 'I''ve taken almost exactly the same image! I don''t know if you had any trouble with focusing, but it was a bugger for me. The breeze was blowing the limb around, so I couldn''t manually focus or auto focus. I think your results are better than what I came up with. I like that you can see other branches, thick with ice, in the background. Hey, I now see that was the challenge, so great job, heh.', '2014-06-11 13:27:01.000000', NULL, 0);
